{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_blitz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_blitz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "团队坚盾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blitz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5cb7383ba0192cbbe752d9df4b998c4aab3fca0f16447bba5262eccdd1f9647a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨尔贡\n焚风热土边境"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一边儿去，没力气和你搭话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能卖些水和吃的给我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（眯眼观察闪击）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哟，原来是雇佣兵老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们村里除了热风和沙子可啥都没有，你来干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我准备去南方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去南方？哈，我看你是热昏了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可是焚风热土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是去焚风热土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（重新打量了一遍闪击）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看你精神不错，没受什么打击，去那寻死干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是去看看，探索一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜猜，其他人是不是把你当疯子给赶走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你找我干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "买些补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佣兵大老爷啊，在这村里一口水一口粮都是命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钱可不顶用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听其他村民说，你负责和别村的人做生意，没错吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，谁会来这种地方买东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（萨尔贡俚语）我想买“三枚金币”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不通顺的维多利亚语）我需要蛋糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（萨尔贡俚语）给你一粒黄沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屋里说话吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎来到罗德岛安全屋，干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你们这帮人是叫干员，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽可能多的干粮和水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真要进焚风热土？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这鬼地方待了四十多年，从来没见人会对那地方感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从那儿刮来的热风每年都会带走不少人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于剩下的，你也看到了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每天在门外一动不动吹风乘凉，说句话都嫌累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是我还会做点买卖，和外面有那么点接触，我这辈子也就那样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但去看一眼总归没什么损失，是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就你们外乡人会感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，我这有个之前你们罗德岛的人留下的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先喝口水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一次有人委托我搞这个什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（口音浓重的维多利亚语）“安全屋”的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们给想要去热土的人留了份须知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不识字，你自己看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（标准维多利亚语）不建议探索焚风热土，若一定要进入请务必确认带足生存资源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这上面写了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建议我带足补给再进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不知道你为什么那么固执，要去那鬼地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样吧，水和物资我这里有，按照那什么规定本来就是要给你们干员的，你自己拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚的水喝了没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么感觉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "脑袋好像不那么涨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就对咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西我会放一水壶，你觉得脑袋不舒服了就抿一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但别一口气喝太多，会产生幻觉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一共一枚金币。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一枚金币？好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？不，兄弟我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回来的时候可能得麻烦你买只驮兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再买些回程的补给，剩下还有多的就麻烦你随便买些特产了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行吧行吧，外乡人花钱都阔气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在这睡一宿还是有其他安排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在就出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行吧兄弟，我也不留你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，怎么称呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闪击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "焚风热土，闪击萨尔贡之旅的最后一站。\n迎接他的是炎热、狂风与沙粒。\n对于泰拉人而言，无尽黄沙，炽热风暴，那就是大地尽头的样貌。\n但在闪击眼中，它却是探索的起点，只要足够坚韧，再加上一些好运气，它或许会为探险家展现真相。\n既然这片沙漠尚无人探索，这里就拥有些微小的可能性。\n万一其中包含了回家的方法呢？\n闪击决定试一试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这样，我进入了热土，然后完好无损地回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇气可嘉，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应该对泰拉各个危险区域做过重点标注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们倒好，全部去了个遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，焚风热土有什么发现吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很希望自己能说出些好消息，但那个地方只有沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战车、霜华，我听说北方冰原那里有很多怪东西，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜华对付过那些怪物，很难缠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真希望能和些有形的东西战斗，至少能证实那里还有生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在焚风热土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空、狂风、沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是一切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里应该不太适合旅游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很无趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也很孤单，闪击这样想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，你跑到萨尔贡探险，有去拜访我们的老朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你是说长泉镇的新领主小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她最近过得还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "处理完那些烦人的怪物之后，新的哥伦比亚公司找上了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听上去不像是什么好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅兰德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅兰德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对方给出了很优渥的条件，但因为之前沃尔沃特科钦斯基闹出的麻烦，皮加尔还是拒绝了许多条款，只确定了最基本的贸易合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长泉镇之前的资金来源主要是出售源石矿，但深层矿场早已封闭，浅层矿场也在那时候被我们爆破，不存在继续出产矿石的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们还能贩卖什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这还得感谢我们的亚历山大先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在那儿闲着无聊，做了很多俄罗斯套娃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说去考察的哥伦比亚人很喜欢这种“萨尔贡”工艺品，梅兰德的人找皮加尔要了独家代理权。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当地人摇身一变，全成了萨尔贡的“传统”手艺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后领主小姐拿这第一桶金找哥伦比亚人买了适宜在荒漠生长的粮食种子，还把镇子翻新了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顺带一提，老领主的宅子被皮加尔修成花园了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以我们的眼光来看，她做得还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——米亚罗医生的墓，还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......墓石一直在被风沙侵蚀，已经有些崩落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我帮他擦了墓碑，献了一束花，然后请当地人做了个小防风棚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想他在另外一个世界过得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总体来说，萨尔贡是个有趣的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的语言发展情况，和我去过的其他国家都大不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是同一个地区的人，都会因为种族差异而带有不同的口音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些音调只在特定的种族中出现，其他种族的人几乎没有复现的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非，他们变成蜥蜴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或是其他什么奇怪生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的关注点很特别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我的专业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到语言，我在萨尔贡路过了一个很特别的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿卡胡拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿......卡......呼......啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是阿卡胡拉，医疗部那位阿达克利斯女士的老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，我听说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没想到在萨尔贡还能找到这样一个天堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，那里的阿达克利斯“热情过度”，能用拳头交流都懒得动口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后盾牌使用频率过高，嘣！坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在离开阿卡胡拉前，我只能暂时用木材加闪光弹制造了一块盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雨林里有不少独特的猎物，蒂娜你会喜欢那里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用餐时间差不多到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位下午有什么安排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我可能得去人事部搞套新制服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨尔贡的沙子算是把整套制服都给毁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再穿着它，我甚至没法隐蔽自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是个人都能沿着一路落下的沙砾找到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是灾难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，两小时后，罗德岛训练场集合，各位没有意见吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经很久没有作为一支小队进行日常训练了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望各位还记得对抗演习的要点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解散，两小时后见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回见，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行动起来吧，库兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天还有许多任务等待着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛\n彩虹小队临时宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新制服、新装备，这下就差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闪击看着宿舍镜子中的自己。\n在这段时间里，他独自一人游历萨尔贡，寻找着回家的线索。\n从萨尔贡或繁荣或颓废的城市，到阿卡胡拉茂密的丛林，没有地方能阻拦他探索的脚步。\n但焚风热土是个例外。\n在那里，似乎时间都被黄沙支配。\n一天，两天，十天。\n眼前的景色从来没有变化过。\n就那么在沙中踏步。\n一无所获。\n他害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他也不清楚自己是何时下定决心返回的，在那段时间里，前进与后退似乎没有区别。\n直到回到那个热土边境的安全屋时，生存的知觉才回到身体上。\n紧接着，就是如潮水般涌来的疲惫。\n每次想起，都感到后怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，状态还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一会请你枪子吃个够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我先过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拍拍闪击的肩膀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熟悉的声音把他从回忆拉回现实。\n他看着自己手中那把改造铳，还有充满电能的盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对抗演习，应该是我和灰烬对付霜华和战车吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "合作，对抗，与战友共同达成战术目标。\n他突然觉得心中充满了干劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该给他们个惊喜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四小时后\n罗德岛本舰训练场"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾有那么一刻，他想过把探索热土的路走到尽头。不成功便成仁。\n但在某一天，多喝了一口安全屋兄弟送的神秘饮料，处于清醒与迷幻的间隙中时，他突然意识到一点：\n自己举盾冲刺，迫切地想要获得成果。\n却把自己的队友们远远甩在了身后。\n伊莱亚斯·库兹，干员闪击。\n职责是护卫队友。\n给霜华创造布陷机会。\n把敌人引向战车的枪前。\n为灰烬提供一些建议。\n而非一人独行，涉险探索。\n他明白了。\n所以现在，他回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都快忘记上一次踩中踏垫是什么感觉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢天谢地，霜华，你没有拿对付怪物的陷阱对付我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把感谢留给灰烬吧，没有那发榴弹你本该出局的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这毕竟只是二对二对抗训练，许多要素要比实际情况简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚历山大的设防位置我已经用无人机确认过多次，所以才敢冒险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果使用的不是训练弹，你没有机会的，灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我钻了这个空子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望我们四个一下子消失，没把艾拉双月她们一起卷进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，我们再也没法凑成一支完整的五人特种小队了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有没有考虑过在这片大地上招募点新人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是反恐特种部队成员，不是军事承包商手底下的雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维护和平是，曾经是，我们唯一的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，这里的和平比地球的还要脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，现在我们要做的，是生存，还有寻找回家的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论有多少新鲜血液，他们都不会和我们一起把这条路走到尽头的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这种差别，真的有那么大吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比我们各自的祖国之间的区别还要大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前有老上司六号给我们擦屁股，现在呢，一切都看我们自己的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许你可以尝试着让自己融入这个世界，灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们离开熟悉的环境很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但适应这里之后，或许会觉得这个糟糕的地方，可能还有些可取之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回家很重要，但那不是全部，科恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在找到回家的路之前，或许可以先想想，怎么去生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样可以让我们放下枪之后，还能行走在这片大地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来自朋友的建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会考虑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不见，彩虹小队的各位干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，灰烬，这是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也是来训练的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者说，是来接受培训的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格瑞斯",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然新的对手就位了，那让我们开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰烬，你不会是想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是干员，我们是彩虹小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望各位能够接受这场挑战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我得换种踏垫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，闪击？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "答案显而易见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拒绝可不是我的选项，灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
